# Allowlist: the build context is the workspace sources, the lockfile and the config the image
# reads, and nothing else (no data, environments, history, notes or env files).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps
!packages
!configs
# Not needed to run.
**/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/node_modules
**/dist
